# Pinned SHA256 of the vendored PDFium rasterizer binary (T08).
# RasterizePdf.ps1 refuses to run against any other build: re-fetching from
# releases/latest silently changes raster output, so a mismatch fails loudly
# instead. To upgrade, replace bin/pdfium.dll from a versioned (never latest)
# release matching VERSION, and update the hash below in the same commit.
